@startuml builtin_command_core
title Builtin Command Core and Parallel Skill Extension
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@a8192e04 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/CompositeCommandRegistry.java resolve.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@8a402bc7 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/BuiltinCommandSource.java constructor.
' Source evidence: pi-mono@4af9d21d packages/coding-agent/src/core/agent-session.ts _tryExecuteExtensionCommand.
' Architecture change: typed source filtering precedes resolution; one catalog preserves descriptor and definition identity.
' Design reason: Skill work proceeds independently; Builtin selection is not a product-wide command ban.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
package "Future application boundary" {
  class CommandCatalogService <<target-only>>
  class CommandExecutionService <<target-only>>
}
package "Core - singleton collaborators" {
  class CompositeCommandRegistry
  interface CommandDefinitionSource {
    kind()
    list(session)
    definitions(session)
  }
  class BuiltinCommandSource
  interface BuiltinCommandContributor
  interface CommandDefinition
  class BuiltinCommandDefinition
  class DisplayCommandDefinition
  interface CommandAdmissionPolicy
  interface CommandHandler
}
package "Request-owned immutable values" {
  class ResolvedCommandCatalog
  class ResolvedCommandDTO
  class CommandSessionSnapshotDTO
  class CommandExecutionContext
}
package "Parallel Skill work" {
  class SkillCommandSource
  class SkillExecutionDefinition <<separate workstream>>
}
CommandCatalogService --> CompositeCommandRegistry
CommandExecutionService --> CompositeCommandRegistry : resolve once
CommandExecutionService --> CommandExecutionContext
CompositeCommandRegistry o-- "0..*" CommandDefinitionSource
BuiltinCommandSource ..|> CommandDefinitionSource
SkillCommandSource ..|> CommandDefinitionSource
BuiltinCommandSource o-- "0..*" BuiltinCommandContributor : startup unique names
BuiltinCommandContributor --> BuiltinCommandDefinition
BuiltinCommandDefinition ..|> CommandDefinition
DisplayCommandDefinition ..|> CommandDefinition
SkillExecutionDefinition ..|> CommandDefinition
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- CommandAdmissionPolicy
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- CommandHandler
CompositeCommandRegistry --> ResolvedCommandCatalog : filter before resolving
ResolvedCommandCatalog o-- "0..*" CommandDefinition : preserve identity
ResolvedCommandCatalog *-- "0..*" ResolvedCommandDTO : describe once
ResolvedCommandCatalog *-- CommandSessionSnapshotDTO
CommandExecutionContext --> ResolvedCommandCatalog : same Help view
note bottom of CommandAdmissionPolicy
Preview only.
Domain writes recheck under locks.
end note
note bottom of CommandExecutionService
No HTTP route in this core PR.
No fake production contributors.
No request credentials in singleton state.
end note
@enduml
